MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Re-sends 6f656bc (reverted in a8e4885, D710) with the fix: the line had a
leading „— ", and scrubMechanicalForStorage turns „\s+—\s+" into „, ", so the
stored ask read „…რჩევას გაუწევ?, X-ის ასისტენტი, X-ის სახელით". The line
now has no dash and stays its own paragraph; a test runs the scrub over
question + line, the text as stored.

